<title>SINGAPORE: Tuan Sing unit buys Malaysian company.</title>
<headline>Tuan Sing unit buys Malaysian company.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tuan Sing Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday it had bought 2.19 million shares of Polymold Tools &amp; Engineering Malaysia Sdn Bhd (Polymold), making it a wholly-owned subsidiary.</p>
<p>Tuan Sing said in a statement that another wholly-owned subsidiary, Statsym Berhad, bought the shares of 1.00 ringgit each.</p>
<p>Polymold is involved in manufacturing of moulds and leasing of property.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
